# Frontend Apps

## Customer PWA (`apps/customer`)

- Mobile-first; no authentication
- Entry: QR URL `https://app.mizline.com/store/{storeId}/table/{tableId}`
- Flow: load store → menu → cart → checkout → order tracking
- Persist cart in localStorage; associate orders with table from URL

## Staff Dashboard (`apps/kitchen`)

Single app for kitchen and admin staff. Runs on port 3001.

- `/kitchen` — Desktop-first KDS with four status columns; real-time via Socket.IO
- `/admin` — Desktop-first store management; JWT auth required (MANAGER+)
- Audio alert on `order.created`; support full-screen mode on kitchen view

## Conventions

- Next.js App Router, TypeScript strict, TailwindCSS + shadcn/ui
- Server Components for data fetching; Client Components for interactivity and sockets
- Shared types in a `packages/types` or `packages/shared` workspace package
